text = "[b][font_size=24]Level: [color=#ffd700]Data Types[/color][/font_size][/b]
[color=#ff4444][b]System Error: Uninitialized Variables[/b][/color]
[b]Objective:[/b]
The code won't compile because the variables are empty! Drag the correct [color=#ffff00]value[/color] into each bucket to initialize them.

[b]The Logic (Java):[/b]
Variables act like containers that only hold specific types of data.

[b][color=#ff5555]1. Integer (int)[/color][/b]
Stores [color=#ff5555]whole numbers[/color]. No quotes allowed.
[code]int x = [color=#ff5555]10[/color];[/code]

[b][color=#4bb8f0]2. String[/color][/b]
Stores [color=#4bb8f0]text[/color]. Must be wrapped in [color=#4bb8f0]\"double quotes\"[/color].
[code]String s = [color=#4bb8f0]\"Hello\"[/color];[/code]

[b][color=#55ff55]3. Boolean[/color][/b]
Stores [color=#55ff55]logic states[/color]. Can only be lowercase [color=#55ff55]true[/color] or [color=#55ff55]false[/color].
[code]boolean b = [color=#55ff55]true[/color];[/code]

Match the [color=#ff5555]colors[/color] to the [color=#4bb8f0]syntax[/color]!

[b][font_size=18 color=#888]💡 Tip: Wrong type? Get a compile error popup![/font_size]"
fit_content = true
scroll_active = false

